    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7413" root="حذر" body-key="H">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاذَرَا</span></b> , (TK,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَاذَرَةٌ</span> (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذَارٌ</span>,
(S,) <i>They two were cautious,</i> or <i>in fear, each of
the other; were on their guard,</i> or <i>in a state of
preparation, each against the other.</i> (TK.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذَارٌ</span>
is <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَاذَرَةٌ</span>, (S,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَاذَرَةٌ</span> is between
two. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 1, in two places.

